# Data and simulator

- Map Meteostat `temp`/`pres`/`rhum` to `temp_c`/`pres_hpa`/`rhum_pct` at the fetch boundary.
- Keep only stations with ≥85% completeness on all three channels. Lock 5 stations in 2 clusters.
- `inject.py` is pure (optional seeded RNG). No FastAPI imports.
- Eval set: 10k rows, 15% injected, storms labeled `GENUINE_WEATHER` with `is_anomaly=false`.
- Streamer: seed 24 clean hours, then POST `/ingest`. No `--fault` flag.

See `docs/data-simulator.md`.
